%% KYNZA — Clean Architecture Layering Per Feature
%% Verified pattern across booking/, dashboard/, team/, billing/, proxipay/ (2026-07-03)
%% DIVERGENCE FROM TEXTBOOK CLEAN ARCHITECTURE (documented, not silently accepted):
%%  1. No datasource abstraction: data/repositories/*_repository_impl.dart calls
%%     SupabaseService.client directly (PostgREST/RPC/Realtime/Functions) instead of
%%     going through a separate local/remote datasource pair.
%%  2. Riverpod providers double as the "application" layer AND as controllers that
%%     screens watch directly — there is no separate use-case/interactor class per
%%     action; the AsyncNotifier IS the use case.
%%  3. domain/repositories holds only abstract interfaces, no entities distinct from
%%     the Freezed models in core/models — models are shared, not re-mapped per layer.
flowchart TB
    subgraph SCREEN["Presentation — presentation/screens, presentation/widgets"]
        S1["Screen (ConsumerWidget/ConsumerStatefulWidget)\nimplements 5 UI states: loading/error/empty/offline/data"]
    end
    subgraph APP["Application — application/providers"]
        A1["Riverpod Provider / AsyncNotifier\n(acts as controller + use case combined)"]
    end
    subgraph DOMAIN["Domain — domain/repositories"]
        D1["abstract XRepository\n(interface only, no logic)"]
    end
    subgraph DATA["Data — data/repositories"]
        DA1["XRepositoryImpl\nimplements domain interface"]
    end
    subgraph EXTERNAL["External"]
        E1["SupabaseService.client\n(PostgREST / RPC / Realtime stream / functions.invoke)"]
    end

    S1 -->|watch/read| A1
    A1 -->|depends on abstract type| D1
    DA1 -.implements.-> D1
    A1 -->|resolved via Riverpod provider override to Impl| DA1
    DA1 --> E1

    S1 -.never imports.-> DA1
    A1 -.never imports.-> E1

    subgraph MODULES["Every lib/features/* module follows this exact 4-box shape"]
        M["auth · automation · availability · billing · booking · dashboard ·\ndata_platform · evolution · home_client · home_manager · home_owner ·\nhome_staff · journey · loyalty · marketing · notifications · payment ·\npermissions · proxipay · referral · reviews · salon · search · services ·\nsettings · splash · staff · team"]
    end
